        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saving Princess of Mars</strong> is an stylish action platformer featuring puzzles to solve and ton of enemies to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Our main protagonist is lumberjack Jack from Earth who surprisingly spawns on Mars where he's trying to save its princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted levels:</strong> Each level is uniquely designed for countless methods of completion. Defeat strange Martian enemies using spontaneous approaches and eliminate them on your way to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exceptional combat:</strong> Adapt to chaos with style: stomp enemies like you're squashing grapes at a festival, deliver kicks that would make a martial arts movie jealous, and turn every encounter into a slapstick ballet of traps and tumbles. No bullets, no mercy—just airborne justice and foot-powered fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple controllable characters</strong>: You will be able to switch between different characters during the gameplay. All controllable characters have different abilities, but of course – our main hero is the strongest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unconventional Storytelling:</strong> A mysterious tale unfolds through cinematic sequences — like a movie that forgot it was a game, took a wrong turn at plot twist junction, and crash-landed into a finale so unexpected it might just file a complaint with reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help Jack save the Princess of Mars... and maybe the entire planet of Mars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.poster.avif?t=1762414401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.webm?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.mp4?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strange Martian enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 engaging large platformer levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up to 4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlockable Hard difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >humoristic comments from characters during conversations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.poster.avif?t=1762414401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.webm?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.mp4?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at last, this game also raises many questions... and some of those are even answers...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there life on Mars?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it look like (life on Mars)?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What help can you get from Prof. One-Rock?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Saving Princess of Mars</strong> is an stylish action platformer featuring puzzles to solve and ton of enemies to eliminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Our main protagonist is lumberjack Jack from Earth who surprisingly spawns on Mars where he's trying to save its princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand-Crafted levels:</strong> Each level is uniquely designed for countless methods of completion. Defeat strange Martian enemies using spontaneous approaches and eliminate them on your way to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exceptional combat:</strong> Adapt to chaos with style: stomp enemies like you're squashing grapes at a festival, deliver kicks that would make a martial arts movie jealous, and turn every encounter into a slapstick ballet of traps and tumbles. No bullets, no mercy—just airborne justice and foot-powered fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple controllable characters</strong>: You will be able to switch between different characters during the gameplay. All controllable characters have different abilities, but of course – our main hero is the strongest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unconventional Storytelling:</strong> A mysterious tale unfolds through cinematic sequences — like a movie that forgot it was a game, took a wrong turn at plot twist junction, and crash-landed into a finale so unexpected it might just file a complaint with reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to help Jack save the Princess of Mars... and maybe the entire planet of Mars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.poster.avif?t=1762414401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.webm?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/101838bc19d3225512e4f559445d536f.mp4?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >strange Martian enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 engaging large platformer levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >up to 4 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unlockable Hard difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >humoristic comments from characters during conversations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.poster.avif?t=1762414401\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.webm?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936890/extras/686cd0ccccb69a31d622d3c0d7504dd8.mp4?t=1762414401\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And at last, this game also raises many questions... and some of those are even answers...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is there life on Mars?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What does it look like (life on Mars)?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What help can you get from Prof. One-Rock?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Saving Princess of Mars is an Old School Pixel Art Humoristic Story Driven Light Platformer. Main protagonist is lumberjack Jack from Earth who spawns on Mars where he finds locked up beautiful Princess of Mars and chooses to save her... But that is just the beginning of his journey!",
